      "message": "when are we calling select_column with col!\u003dCOL_TRI_STATE_ALL and scanning disabled ?\nis it just when a power key press happens in the middle of the keyboard scanning ?",
      "revId": "eb8679ec38fec90f6ebaef3bf0f6814700b62383",
