        "id": 1000253
      },
      "writtenOn": "2012-07-25T20:25:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we\u0027re doing everything right in the keyboard_scan_task() and keyboard_enable_scanning(), then I don\u0027t think this should be necessary (plz correct me if there\u0027s a reason I\u0027m not seeing).\n\nI\u0027d prefer to keep this function as simple as possible and keep enable/disable logic elsewhere.",
      "parentUuid": "AAAAMX//++E\u003d",
      "revId": "eb8679ec38fec90f6ebaef3bf0f6814700b62383",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
