      "writtenOn": "2012-07-25T20:25:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think you can get rid of the keyboard_get_scanning_enabled() call in the while-loop condition. The one in the if-statement here is redundant, but you should probably keep this in case scanning is disabled during the usleep().",
      "revId": "eb8679ec38fec90f6ebaef3bf0f6814700b62383",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
